      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "5 · Tenancy and the security model",
      "originalText": "5 · Tenancy and the security model",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "21c51ad4ee094aef8450",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1556493282,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 341140777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dc42c637c5f54fc8baee"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 3170,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "dc42c637c5f54fc8baee",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 365080080,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2132692552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1248,
      "y": 3210.0,
      "width": 484,
      "height": 120.0,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Every tenant table carries org_id and FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.\nPolicies test  org_id = kna_current_org(),  a per-transaction\nsetting. A SUPERUSER connection makes all of it SILENTLY inert —\npolicies still exist, the invariant check still passes, and every\ntenant reads every other tenant's source.\n\nassertRlsEffective() runs at startup in every service and refuses\nto serve otherwise.",
      "originalText": "Every tenant table carries org_id and FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.\nPolicies test  org_id = kna_current_org(),  a per-transaction\nsetting. A SUPERUSER connection makes all of it SILENTLY inert —\npolicies still exist, the invariant check still passes, and every\ntenant reads every other tenant's source.\n\nassertRlsEffective() runs at startup in every service and refuses\nto serve otherwise.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "21c51ad4ee094aef8450",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "a55b050e4ffc47ef853a",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 272812827,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 59160709,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "2b019556c2014e4e8899"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1780,
      "y": 3170,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "2b019556c2014e4e8899",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 324593663,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1268759748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1788,
      "y": 3202.5,
      "width": 524,
      "height": 135.0,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Reads that happen BEFORE a tenant is known need a narrow probe:\n\nwithAuthProbe        bearer token -> principal\n                     naming the hash proves possession\nwithIdentityProbe    provider subject -> principals\n                     authorised by HMAC, not by identity\nwithRepoProbe        git remote -> repo, for webhooks\n\nAnything reading AFTER a principal exists uses withOrgContext.",
      "originalText": "Reads that happen BEFORE a tenant is known need a narrow probe:\n\nwithAuthProbe        bearer token -> principal\n                     naming the hash proves possession\nwithIdentityProbe    provider subject -> principals\n                     authorised by HMAC, not by identity\nwithRepoProbe        git remote -> repo, for webhooks\n\nAnything reading AFTER a principal exists uses withOrgContext.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a55b050e4ffc47ef853a",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "f9de687f28284974a02c",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1943155077,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 999339856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "5fa541d3f094452f9307"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 3400,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "5fa541d3f094452f9307",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1731949819,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1408444750,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1248,
      "y": 3435.0,
      "width": 1064,
      "height": 120.0,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Six guardrail layers\n\n1  minimise      only what a question needs leaves the repo\n2  scan          fail closed on a finding, before publish\n3  classify      sensitivity tier per chunk, restricted never embedded\n4  ACL in SQL    the caller's permissions as a query predicate\n5  injection     retrieved content wrapped as untrusted data\n6  audit         every read recorded by chunk id, breadth monitored",
      "originalText": "Six guardrail layers\n\n1  minimise      only what a question needs leaves the repo\n2  scan          fail closed on a finding, before publish\n3  classify      sensitivity tier per chunk, restricted never embedded\n4  ACL in SQL    the caller's permissions as a query predicate\n5  injection     retrieved content wrapped as untrusted data\n6  audit         every read recorded by chunk id, breadth monitored",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "f9de687f28284974a02c",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 9
    },
